      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "SeraphineW",
        "name": "Surround Sound",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Seraphine Shields and Hastes nearby allies. If she is already Shielded she will Heal nearby allies as well.",
        "bodyHtml": "Seraphine spurs her nearby allied champions in song, granting them <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(8% + (0.8% per 100 Ability Power)) Move Speed</span>, herself <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(20% + (2% per 100 Ability Power)) decaying Move Speed</span> and both <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(60/80/100/120/140 + (20% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for 2.5 seconds.<br /><br />If Seraphine is already <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shielded</span>, she calls out to her allies to join her, restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">8/10/12/14/16% missing Health</span> to them after a 2.5 second delay.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability only heals once, even if cast twice.</span>",
