        "id": "SeraphineE",
        "name": "Beat Drop",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Seraphine deals damage and impairs the movement of enemies in a line.",
        "bodyHtml": "Seraphine unleashes a heavy soundwave, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/100/130/160/190 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies in a line and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 99% for 1.1/1.2/1.3/1.4/1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Enemies that are already <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooted</span> instead, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilized</span> enemies are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 70% damage against minions.</span>",
