        "bodyHtml": "Seraphine takes the stage, projecting a captivating force that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Charms</span> for 1.25/1.5/1.75 seconds and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/200/250 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br />Any champions struck (including allies) become part of the performance, extending the range of this Ability. Allied champions gain maximum <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Notes</span>.",
